abstract: >-
  DATA-AI — a self-hosted single-backend AI agent platform. FastAPI + React 19 with streaming chat, single- and multi-agent teams, RAG, memory, ContextStore, code sandbox, intent normalization, 4 ready-made enterprise agent presets, 30+ office tools, and 19 LLM providers.
